What was modified in upstream files
-----------------------------------
  src/js/aos.js                 additive only:
                                  - `scrub`, `scrubMode`, `respectReducedMotion` options
                                  - new exports: scrub, scrubFromAttributes, getEngine, destroy
                                  - one stylesheet import changed from default-import to
                                    side-effect import (Vite 6 no longer exposes a default
                                    export for CSS; upstream rollup extraction is unaffected)
  src/sass/aos.scss             one added @import: 'scrub'

Everything else under src/, cypress/ and demo/ is untouched.

